    "#### Feature Engineering - \n",
    "1) CareerLength = EndYear - StartYear + 1\n",
    "2) GoalsPerGame = {TotalGoals}/{GamesPlayed}\n",
    "3) AssistsPerGame = {TotalAssists}/{GamesPlayed}\n",
    "4) career era\n",
    "For example, a player's 300 goals in one era might represent a different level of achievement from 300 goals in another era.\n",
    "\n",
    "You could create:\n",
    "- 1910s–1940s\n",
    "- 1950s\n",
    "- 1960s\n",
    "- 1970s\n",
    "- 1980s\n",
    "- 1990s\n",
    "- 2000s\n",
    "- 2010s\n",
    "- 2020s\n",
    "Alternatively, use decade as a categorical feature.\n",
    "5) time on ice\n"
